@baseUrl = https://license-server.example.invalid
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_API_ACCESS_TOKEN
@organizationId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@azureSubscription = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@snapshotId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@baselineScanId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
@currentScanId = 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555
@foreignSnapshotId = 99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
@foreignSubscription = 88888888-8888-8888-8888-888888888888

# Documentation only: the host, token and identities above are placeholders.
# API routes read/save client evidence; they NEVER launch a live cloud collector.
# Collect on the client only after explicit account selection, CLI connection and
# per-run consent. Replace this illustrative payload with actual collector output.
# Saving/analyzing requires ManagePolicies + ViewInventory + ViewFindings;
# history/detail require monitoring read access and an exact organization binding.
# Provider JSON uses the existing enum values: Azure=0, Aws=1, Gcp=2.

### Save explicitly collected Azure metadata (201; immutable identity conflicts 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "snapshotId": "{{snapshotId}}",
  "provider": 0,
  "accountId": "{{azureSubscription}}",
  "startedAtUtc": "2026-11-08T10:00:00Z",
  "collectedAtUtc": "2026-11-08T10:00:15Z",
  "source": "Azure CLI / Microsoft Graph Entra application credentials and federation",
  "observations": [
    {
      "principalId": "66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666",
      "principalName": "Illustrative client workload",
      "kind": "FederatedIdentityCredential",
      "evidenceId": "77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777",
      "name": "Illustrative federation",
      "issuer": "https://issuer.example.invalid",
      "subject": "system:serviceaccount:namespace:workload",
      "audiences": ["api://AzureADTokenExchange"],
      "validFromUtc": null,
      "validUntilUtc": null,
      "metadataSha256": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
    }
  ],
  "limitations": ["Partial source coverage. Example only; use real metadata hashes from the consented client collector."],
  "credentialInventoryComplete": false,
  "trustInventoryComplete": false
}

### Saved Azure history (200; up to 50 snapshots; no live collection)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-evidence?provider=Azure&accountId={{azureSubscription}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Saved AWS history (selected bound account, existing report can be stale)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-evidence?provider=Aws&accountId=123456789012
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Saved GCP history (selected bound project only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-evidence?provider=Gcp&accountId=sample-project-123
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read one saved snapshot (200, or 404 for an unknown ID in a bound account)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-evidence/{{snapshotId}}?provider=Azure&accountId={{azureSubscription}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Compare saved metadata to the latest exact, strictly earlier compatible baseline
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-monitoring/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": 0,
  "accountId": "{{azureSubscription}}",
  "trustCredentialSnapshotId": "{{snapshotId}}",
  "baselineScanId": null,
  "currentScanId": null
}

### Compare saved effective-access scans; assignment evidence remains Potential
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-monitoring/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": 0,
  "accountId": "{{azureSubscription}}",
  "trustCredentialSnapshotId": null,
  "baselineScanId": "{{baselineScanId}}",
  "currentScanId": "{{currentScanId}}"
}

### Unknown/foreign snapshot within an authorized binding (404; no cross-account lookup)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-evidence/{{foreignSnapshotId}}?provider=Azure&accountId={{azureSubscription}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unbound/foreign account (403; stored/live evidence cannot be accessed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-evidence?provider=Azure&accountId={{foreignSubscription}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Invalid unmatched scan pair (400; both baseline and current are required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/trust-credential-monitoring/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": 0,
  "accountId": "{{azureSubscription}}",
  "trustCredentialSnapshotId": null,
  "baselineScanId": "{{baselineScanId}}",
  "currentScanId": null
}
